  --version                 Show the version and exit.
  -h, --help                Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  config    Read and change remote configuration.
  logs      Show recent log lines of SERVICES.
  promote   Promote SERVICE from staging to prod. (DEPRECATED: Use 'release'
            instead.)
  release   Release VERSION of SERVICE.
  rollback  Roll SERVICE back to an earlier release.
  scale     Change how SERVICE scales.
  status    Show what runs where.
  sync      Copy service DIRS to the deploy host.
  user      Manage deploy users.
== run 4: deployctl --version
exit: 0
deployctl, version 2.7.0
== run 5: deployctl release --help
exit: 0
deployctl: verbose=0, env='dev', invoked='release'
Usage: deployctl release [OPTIONS] SERVICE VERSION

  Release VERSION of SERVICE.

  The release waits for every pod to pass its health check before it moves on,
  and stops at the first failure.

Options:
  -r, --replicas INTEGER RANGE    Pods to run.  [default: 2; 1<=x<=20]
  --timeout FLOAT RANGE           Seconds to wait for health checks.  [0<x<=600]
  -t, --tag TEXT                  Image tag to add; can be repeated.
  --strategy [rolling|blue-green|canary]
                                  [default: rolling]
  --at [%Y-%m-%d|%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S|%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S]
                                  Schedule the release.
  --id UUID                       Release id to reuse.
  --notes FILENAME                Release notes file.
  --manifest FILE                 Service manifest.
  --dry-run / --no-dry-run        Plan without applying.
  -h, --help                      Show this message and exit.
== run 6: deployctl logs --help
exit: 0
deployctl: verbose=0, env='dev', invoked='logs'
Usage: deployctl logs [OPTIONS] SERVICES...

  Show recent log lines of SERVICES.

Options:
  -n, --lines INTEGER RANGE       Lines to show.  [x>=0]
  -f, --follow                    Keep streaming.
  --level [debug|info|warn|error]
  --since [%Y-%m-%d]
  --grep PATTERN                  Only lines matching PATTERN.
  -h, --help                      Show this message and exit.
